WEBVTT

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:01.960
150%

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:05.600
I love, I love animals a lot

00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:07.380
especially birds

00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:11.980
with all of this new experience I'm living

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:15.020
with the documentaries I'm making

00:00:15.220 --> 00:00:17.680
about animals of the Sierra Nevada de Santa Marta

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.660
and birds of the Sierra Nevada de Santa Marta

00:00:21.380 --> 00:00:26.000
I've fallen even more in love with everything nature is

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:32.300
especially knowing that Colombia is one of the most beautiful, biodiverse countries in the world,

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:35.160
number one in birds, so I want to know them all.
